{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00341","headline":"赠别唐太师道袭 · 蜀高祖王建","name":"赠别唐太师道袭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丱岁便将爲肘腋，二纪何曾离一日。\n更深犹尚立案前，敷奏柔和不伤物。\n今朝荣贵慰我心，双旌引向重城出。\n褒斜旧地委勳贤，从此生灵永泰息。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蜀高祖王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00341.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00341","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}